TITLE Pure water pH 3, 100C, equilibrate with minerals; find pe
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 3 charge
    pe 4
    redox pe
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    K-mica 0 10
    Kaolinite 0 10
    Dolomite 0 10
    Epsomite 0 10
    Fe(OH)3(a) 0 10
    Halite 0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings pe
    10 PUNCH PE
END
